---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="お問い合わせ | 偉人ラボ"
  description="IJIN LABへのお問い合わせ、記事への感想、掲載依頼などはこちらから。"
>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="contact-hero">
    <div class="hero-noise" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="container contact-hero-inner">
      <p class="eyebrow">◉ IJIN LAB — CONTACT</p>
      <h1 class="contact-title">お問い合わせ</h1>
      <p class="contact-lead">記事への感想、ご意見、掲載依頼など、お気軽にどうぞ。</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="container contact-body">

    <!-- SNS -->
    <section class="contact-section">
      <p class="section-label">// QUICK CONTACT</p>
      <h2>SNSで気軽に話しかけてください</h2>
      <p>一番早く届く方法はInstagramのDMです。感想・質問・リクエストなんでも歓迎。</p>

      <div class="sns-cards">
        <a
          href="https://www.instagram.com/ijin_lab/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="sns-card"
        >
          <span class="sns-icon">📸</span>
          <div class="sns-info">
            <span class="sns-name">Instagram</span>
            <span class="sns-handle">@ijin_lab</span>
            <span class="sns-desc">DM・コメントで受け付けています</span>
          </div>
          <span class="sns-arrow">→</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- フォーム -->
    <section class="contact-section">
      <p class="section-label">// FORM</p>
      <h2>メールフォーム</h2>
      <p>企業からの掲載依頼・取材依頼はこちらのフォームからお願いします。<br />2〜3営業日以内に返信します。</p>

      <form
        class="contact-form"
        action="https://formspree.io/f/xdkojpvv"
        method="POST"
      >
        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="name" class="form-label">お名前 <span class="required">*</span></label>
          <input type="text" id="name" name="name" class="form-input" required placeholder="山田 太郎" />
        </div>

        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="email" class="form-label">メールアドレス <span class="required">*</span></label>
          <input type="email" id="email" name="email" class="form-input" required placeholder="example@email.com" />
        </div>

        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="subject" class="form-label">件名</label>
          <input type="text" id="subject" name="subject" class="form-input" placeholder="記事リクエスト・感想など" />
        </div>

        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="message" class="form-label">メッセージ <span class="required">*</span></label>
          <textarea id="message" name="message" class="form-textarea" required rows="6" placeholder="記事の感想、リクエスト、ご質問など..."></textarea>
        </div>

        <button type="submit" class="submit-btn">送信する →</button>
      </form>
    </section>

    <!-- よくある質問 -->
    <section class="contact-section">
      <p class="section-label">// FAQ</p>
      <h2>よくある質問</h2>

      <dl class="faq-list">
        <div class="faq-item">
          <dt>記事のリクエストはできますか？</dt>
          <dd>はい。「この人物について書いてほしい」「この悩みに効く偉人を教えてほしい」などInstagramのDMかフォームで教えてください。全部は対応できませんが、面白そうなものは取り上げます。</dd>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <dt>記事の内容について誤りがあった場合は？</dt>
          <dd>お知らせいただければすぐに確認・修正します。歴史的解釈については諸説あるものも多いため、参考文献と合わせてご指摘いただけると助かります。</dd>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <dt>記事を引用・転載したい場合は？</dt>
          <dd>一部引用（出典明記あり）は問題ありません。全文転載はご遠慮ください。</dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </section>

  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  /* ── Hero ── */
  .contact-hero {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4C1D95 0%, #1e1b4b 100%);
    padding: calc(var(--nav-height) + 4rem) 0 4rem;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .hero-noise {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox='0 0 256 256' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cfilter id='noise'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='0.9' numOctaves='4' stitchTiles='stitch'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23noise)' opacity='0.04'/%3E%3C/svg%3E");
    opacity: 0.4;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .contact-hero-inner {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 1.5rem;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.62rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.25em;
    color: var(--amber);
    margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
    opacity: 0.9;
  }

  .contact-title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.8rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #fff;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .contact-lead {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  /* ── Body ── */
  .contact-body {
    padding: 4rem 1.5rem 6rem;
  }

  .contact-section {
    margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
    padding-bottom: 3.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }
  .contact-section:last-of-type { border-bottom: none; }

  .section-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.62rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    color: var(--violet);
    margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  .contact-section h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--ink);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    padding-left: 0.9rem;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--violet);
  }

  .contact-section p {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    line-height: 2;
    color: var(--ink2);
    margin-bottom: 1.4rem;
  }

  /* ── SNS Cards ── */
  .sns-cards {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .sns-card {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.2rem;
    padding: 1.1rem 1.4rem;
    background: var(--bg2);
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    border-radius: 8px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: border-color 0.2s, background 0.2s;
  }
  .sns-card:hover {
    border-color: rgba(124,58,237,0.4);
    background: rgba(124,58,237,0.04);
  }

  .sns-icon {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .sns-info {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.2rem;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .sns-name {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .sns-handle {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--violet);
  }

  .sns-desc {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--ink3);
  }

  .sns-arrow {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--ink3);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  /* ── Form ── */
  .contact-form {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.4rem;
    margin-top: 1.6rem;
  }

  .form-group {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .form-label {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .required {
    color: var(--violet);
    margin-left: 0.2rem;
  }

  .form-input,
  .form-textarea {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--ink);
    background: var(--bg2);
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    outline: none;
    transition: border-color 0.2s;
    width: 100%;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .form-input:focus,
  .form-textarea:focus {
    border-color: var(--violet);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(124,58,237,0.12);
  }

  .form-input::placeholder,
  .form-textarea::placeholder {
    color: var(--ink3);
    opacity: 0.6;
  }

  .form-textarea {
    resize: vertical;
    min-height: 140px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .submit-btn {
    align-self: flex-start;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0.85rem 2.2rem;
    background: var(--violet);
    color: #fff;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 980px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background 0.2s, transform 0.1s;
  }
  .submit-btn:hover { background: #6d28d9; }
  .submit-btn:active { transform: scale(0.98); }

  /* ── FAQ ── */
  .faq-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0;
    margin-top: 1.4rem;
  }

  .faq-item {
    padding: 1.3rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }
  .faq-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }

  .faq-item dt {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }

  .faq-item dd {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.87rem;
    color: var(--ink2);
    line-height: 1.85;
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .contact-hero { padding: calc(var(--nav-height) + 2.5rem) 0 2.5rem; }
    .submit-btn { width: 100%; justify-content: center; }
  }
</style>
